---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pragathi" description="FA4C's environmental development programme through plantation drives and eco-awareness.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/our-programmes/" class="hover:text-[#1a6b3c]">Our Programmes</a> / <span class="text-gray-800">Pragathi</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1a6b3c] mb-2">Pragathi <span class="text-2xl">🌱</span></h1>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#e87722] mb-8"></div>

    <img src="/images/2016/05/FA4Change-Pragathi-Program.jpg" alt="Pragathi Programme" class="rounded-xl shadow-md mb-8 w-full object-cover max-h-72" />

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700">
      <p>
        We work for environmental development. All the programmes conducted by us related to environmental development are considered as a part of 'Pragathi'.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1a6b3c] mt-8 mb-4">Our Activities</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-2">
        <li>Plantation programmes at housing areas, schools, and colleges.</li>
        <li>Environmental awareness drives and workshops.</li>
        <li>Partnering with local communities to maintain green spaces.</li>
        <li>Encouraging eco-friendly practices among youth and students.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="/our-programmes/" class="border border-[#1a6b3c] text-[#1a6b3c] font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#1a6b3c] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm">← All Programmes</a>
      <a href="/contribute-now/" class="bg-[#e87722] text-white font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#d06820] transition-colors text-sm">Support This Programme</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
